{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 112,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise the LORD! is the man who fears the LORD, who delights greatly in his commandments.",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "112:1 Hebrew: יה Yah. Psalm 112 is an acrostic poem, with each verse after the initial “Praise the LORD!” starting with a letter of the alphabet (ordered from Alef to Tav)."
          },
          {
            "id": "f2",
            "text": "112:1 LORD or GOD in all caps is from the Hebrew יהוה Yahweh except when otherwise noted as being from the short form יה Yah."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要赞美耶和华！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要讚美耶和華！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "His offspring will be mighty in the land. The generation of the upright will be blessed.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他的后裔在世必强盛；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他的後裔在世必強盛；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "Wealth and riches are in his house. His righteousness endures forever.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他家中有货物，有钱财；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他家中有貨物，有錢財；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Light dawns in the darkness for the upright, gracious, merciful, and righteous.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "正直人在黑暗中，有光向他发现；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "正直人在黑暗中，有光向他發現；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "It is well with the man who deals graciously and lends. He will maintain his cause in judgment.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "施恩与人、借贷与人的，这人事情顺利；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "施恩與人、借貸與人的，這人事情順利；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "For he will never be shaken. The righteous will be remembered forever.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他永不动摇；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他永不動搖；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "He will not be afraid of evil news. His heart is steadfast, trusting in the LORD.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他必不怕凶恶的信息；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他必不怕凶惡的信息；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "His heart is established. He will not be afraid in the end when he sees his adversaries.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他心确定，总不惧怕， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他心確定，總不懼怕， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "He has dispersed, he has given to the poor. His righteousness endures forever. His horn will be exalted with honor.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他施舍，周济贫穷；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他施捨，賙濟貧窮；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "The wicked will see it, and be grieved. He shall gnash with his teeth, and melt away. The desire of the wicked will perish.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "恶人看见便恼恨，必咬牙而消化；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "惡人看見便惱恨，必咬牙而消化；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}